  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At Cao Fu, Hei tribe camp, tents and Gu houses cover the wide grassland, tribe flags flutter in the wind, and large numbers of Gu Masters enter and exit; from above they resemble a nest of ants.",
      "chapters": [
        522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_hei_tribe_main_camp",
        "sys_gu_house",
        "fac_gu_masters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While looking toward Imperial Court blessed land, Ma tribe speakers say they must survey other regions too, naming Yu Tian and Meng Qiu alongside Cao Fu. Intel then reports that Dong Fang tribe has already subjugated Zhao tribe and become the ruler there.",
      "chapters": [
        489
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_imperial_court_blessed_land",
        "fac_ma_tribe",
        "loc_yu_tian",
        "fac_dong_fang_tribe",
        "fac_zhao_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration lists Tian Chuan, Meng Qiu, Cao Fu, and every other region of northern plains as already engaging in battle while Hei tribe holds back. Hei Lou Lan tells Fang Yuan he wants to attack Cao Fu and eradicate Dong Fang tribe. The next day Hei tribe pulls out camp and begins a majestic expedition toward Cao Fu, and Cao Fu prepares for a great battle. Unlike Yu Tian, Dong Fang tribe holds the greatest dominance in Cao Fu’s heroes assembly, with only Zhao tribe barely resisting harsh alliance conditions.",
      "chapters": [
        501
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "war-theater",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_chuan",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Narration states that Zhao tribe’s main headquarters is in this Cao Fu region, while Hei tribe represents Yu Tian’s tyrants and has already sworn with allies.",
      "chapters": [
        502
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribes-in-cao-fu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Speakers call Dong Fang tribe the same as Hei tribe, a super tribe with deep foundations and a preeminent huge force in Cao Fu region.",
      "chapters": [
        503
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "tribes-in-cao-fu",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hei alliance army forms into a current as it flows toward Cao Fu.",
      "chapters": [
        506
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribes-advance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Hei tribe breaks five defense lines in a row, Dong Fang army retreats to the final defense line in the central zone of Cao Fu and is firmly surrounded by Hei tribe.",
      "chapters": [
        517
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribes-advance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A scene heading places the supply camp at Cao Fu, Hei tribe camp, with tents and Gu houses covering the wide grassland.",
      "chapters": [
        522
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribes-camp",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After resting and reorganizing for over ten days at Cao Fu, Hei Lou Lan finishes absorbing captives, expands military strength by sixty percent, and resumes the expedition.",
      "chapters": [
        523
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "hei-tribes-camp",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
